***
*** Rule 4's positive fixture: a single `=` inside an `if … then … else … fi` term
*** (from the research appendix of .agents/planning/port-linter.py/research/maude-lexical.md).
***

fmod EQ-IN-IF is
    protecting NAT .
    protecting BOOL .

    op f : Nat -> Nat .
    var N : Nat .

    eq f(N) = if N = 0 then 0 else 1 fi .
endfm
